      "cooked": "<p>This got asked in this thread&nbsp;<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/surprise-shift-questions-21233\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/surprise-shift-questions-21233</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>As it stands currently the best answer I can give is the one I posted there still. &nbsp;&nbsp;From discussions elsewhere it&nbsp;would appear Surprise Shift is available to use regardless of what Form you’re in. &nbsp;However, Change Form is only available when in your Base Form. &nbsp;It still should be clarified further otherwise Surprise Shift does seem outright worse. &nbsp;</p>",
